      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\">The correct answer is <strong>&#39;</strong><span style=\"\"><strong>Vrindavan&#39;</strong>.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Key Points</u></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The<strong> Pagal Baba Temple</strong> is a famous<strong> Hindu temple </strong>of<strong> Lord Krishna</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(104, 104, 104);   \">in <strong>Vrindavan</strong>,<strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><strong><span style=\"\">Uttar Pradesh.</span></strong></li>\n\t<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">It is famous for&nbsp;<span style=\"\">its <strong>puppet exhibition.</strong></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">A puppet show is organized on the<strong> ground floor of the temple throughout the year.</strong></li>\n\t<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">The puppets exhibit the <strong>scenes </strong>of the famous <strong>epics</strong> of India &ndash; the <strong>Ramayana</strong> and the <strong>Mahabharata</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<u><strong><span style=\"\">Vrindavan.</span></strong></u></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Let&#39;s have a look at other options:</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:70%;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Place</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Famous Temple</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"\">Ayodhya</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Ram Mandir,&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(77, 81, 86);  \">Hanuman Garhi Mandir&nbsp;</span></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"\">Chitrakoot</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Bharat Milap temple,&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(77, 81, 86);  \">Sati Anusuya&nbsp;</span>Temple</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"\">Varanasi</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Kashi Vishwanath Temple,&nbsp;&nbsp;Maa Annapurna Temple</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n",
