      "solution": "<p>The Correct Answer is <u><strong>Option 4</strong></u> i.e&nbsp;<u><strong>All the above pairs are correctly matched</strong></u>.</p>\n\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:350px;\">\n\t<colgroup>\n\t\t<col />\n\t\t<col />\n\t</colgroup>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>State&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Name of the puppet show</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Kind of Puppet</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><strong>Andhra Pradesh</strong></u></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><strong>Tholu Bommalata</strong></u></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><strong>Shadow</strong></u><strong> </strong><u><strong>puppet</strong></u></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\">Andhra Pradesh</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\">Koyya Bommalat</span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">a</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">String Puppet</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><strong>Karnataka</strong></u></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><strong>Gombeyatta</strong></u></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><strong>Shadow puppet</strong></u></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\">Karnataka</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\">Togalu Gombeyatta</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: cente