      "id": "a9e1ea78efe7-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "Which of the following Khayal is famous for its presentation of the stories of Ramayana and Mahabharata?",
      "questionHtml": "<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Which of the following Khayal is famous for its presentation of the stories of Ramayana and Mahabharata?</font></font>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Hela Khyal",
          "html": "Hela Khyal"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Kanhaiya Khyal",
          "html": "<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Kanhaiya Khyal</font></font>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Turra Kalangee Khyal",
          "html": "<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Turra Kalangee Khyal</font></font>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Ali Bakshi khayal",
          "html": "<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Ali Bakshi khayal</font></font>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">The correct answer&nbsp; </font></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">is Kanhaiya Khyal.</font></font></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Key Points</font></font></u></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">kanhaiya thought</font></font></span></strong>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">In the areas like Karauli, Bharatpur, Sawai Madhopur, Dholpur </font></font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">and&nbsp;</font></font></span><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> Dausa, Kanhaiya Khyal is famous for its presentation of the stories of Ramayana and Mahabharata.</font></font></strong></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">This idea </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">is </font></font><strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">mainly prevalent among the Meena caste .</font></font></strong></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">In this khayal, </font></font><strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">people of castes like Gujjar, Meena, Mali etc. are the players and instruments like nagada, dhap, chimte and cymbals etc.</font></font></strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> are used.</font></font></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">The character &#39;Mediya&#39; plays an important role </font><strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">in the presentation of Kanhaiya folk song .</font></strong></font></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">The exercise is performed under the leadership of </font><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">the character &#39;Media&#39; , who sings this song while standing in a circle.</font></span></font></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Its characteristic feature is the long reverse side at the end of the line.</font></font></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">These wrestling matches </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">are </font></font><strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">organised during the day in the months of May-June .</font></font></strong></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Kanhaiya&nbsp; </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">is called </font></font><strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&#39;kahan&#39; in the thought .</font></font></strong></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Additional Information</font></font></u></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">hey care</font></font></span>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">This idea&nbsp; </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">is prevalent in the areas like </font></font><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Dausa, Laxmangarh and Sawaimadhopur&nbsp; etc.</font></font></span></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">In this thought&nbsp; </font></font><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">the wrestling competition</font></font></span><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> &nbsp;starts with music.</font></font></li>\n\t\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Naubat instrument&nbsp;</font></font></span><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> is used </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">in this&nbsp; .</font></font></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Its&nbsp; main feature </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">has been </font></font><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&#39;hela dena&#39; (speaking in a long tone)&nbsp; .</font></font></span></li>\n\t\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">The poet Hella made this idea famous.</font></font></span></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li><strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">ali bakshi khayal</font></font></strong>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">This idea is popular and prevalent in </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">eastern Rajasthan especially in </font></font><strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Alwar .</font></font></strong></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Its </font></font><strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">founder Rao Ali Bux</font></font></strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> was a native of Mundawar estate of Alwar.</font></font></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Turra - Kalangee thought</font></font></span>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">This &#39;Khayal&#39;&nbsp; </font></font><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">was composed in the 16th century by two saints, Muslim saint Shah Ali of Mewar and Hindu saint Tuknagir.</font></font></span></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">In this&nbsp; </font></font><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">, Turra is considered as the symbol of Mahadev &#39;Shiva&#39; and Kalngi</font></font></span><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> &nbsp;is considered as the symbol of &#39;Parvati&#39;.</font></font></li>\n\t\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Tukangir </font></font></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">was a supporter of &#39;Turra&#39;, he wore saffron clothes</font></font></span><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> .</font></font></li>\n\t\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Shah Ali was a supporter of &#39;Kalangi&#39; and used to wear green clothes.</font></font></span></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Both these players brought the ideas of Shiva-Shakti to popular life through &#39;Turra Kalangi&#39;.&nbsp;</font></font></li>\n\t\t<li><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Turra-Kalangi&#39;s khayal is popular in Rajasthan and Madhya Pradesh, the first khayal played among the khayals is known as &quot;Turra-Kalangi&quot;.</font></font></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
